# Authoring Packet

`gmeow:AuthoringPacket` · Class

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| CURIE | `gmeow:AuthoringPacket` |
| IRI | `https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/AuthoringPacket` |
| Category | Class |
| Slice | [GMEOW Guides Module](../../slices/guides/index.md) |

![completeness: Docs 10/17](../../badges/completeness/10.svg) ![stability: stable](../../badges/stability/stable.svg) ![category: Class](../../badges/category/class.svg) ![box: TBox](../../badges/box/boxtbox.svg) ![stereotype: AbstractIndividualType](../../badges/stereotype/abstractindividualtype.svg)

## Definition

A self\-contained authoring brief for one batch of a slice's terms: a reified value structure that gathers, for each covered term, its definition and axioms, its bounded graph neighbourhood and definitional\-dependency closure, a handful of same\-slice exemplar coats that passed the SHACL validation gate \(a term with any shape violation is never surfaced\), and its cross\-ontology and cross\-lingual grounding — the mapped external entity plus fr/zh labels JOINed from the slice's translation catalogs\. It is authoring context assembled for a human or agent, not an axiom over the modelled world; it is an abstract information structure \(a value structure\), and every instance is a deterministic projection of gmeow\.gts\.

